1
00:00:11,791 --> 00:00:13,750
The Godfather ditched his own
victory banquet

2
00:00:13,750 --> 00:00:14,500
with his new bride.

3
00:00:16,791 --> 00:00:19,125
The whole continent’s
wondering where the Godfather

4
00:00:19,125 --> 00:00:20,708
took his wife for their honeymoon.

5
00:00:20,708 --> 00:00:22,333
But there’s no
way they’d hide out

6
00:00:22,333 --> 00:00:24,500
in a shithole
border town like this.

7
00:00:29,625 --> 00:00:32,500
Old man, where's this month's protection money?

8
00:00:32,583 --> 00:00:33,416
Please, sir!

9
00:00:33,625 --> 00:00:35,625
You've already collected three times this month!

10
00:00:35,625 --> 00:00:36,625
We have nothing left!

11
00:00:36,625 --> 00:00:37,875
No money?

12
00:00:40,125 --> 00:00:41,750
Your girl's pretty.

13
00:00:42,125 --> 00:00:44,125
Her virginity will do.

14
00:00:45,083 --> 00:00:46,333
Take her!

15
00:00:48,375 --> 00:00:49,583
No!

16
00:00:49,916 --> 00:00:52,458
- Father, help me!
- Please, spare my daughter!

17
00:00:55,791 --> 00:00:57,416
Let her go.

18
00:00:58,083 --> 00:01:00,125
Who the hell are you, kid?

19
00:01:01,625 --> 00:01:03,125
Mind your own business.

20
00:01:03,125 --> 00:01:04,500
You know who backs me?

21
00:01:04,500 --> 00:01:06,791
The Holy Knight
of the Sovereign Sanctum!

22
00:01:07,333 --> 00:01:09,583
Holy Knight? What's that?

23
00:01:09,583 --> 00:01:12,000
I could make him kneel
with a flick of my finger.

24
00:01:12,708 --> 00:01:14,958
What bullshit!

25
00:01:14,958 --> 00:01:16,708
Make a Holy Knight kneel?

26
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:18,625
You think you're the Godfather?!

27
00:01:19,083 --> 00:01:21,041
Only he can do that!

28
00:01:21,541 --> 00:01:23,291
That's right.

29
00:01:23,291 --> 00:01:25,166
I'm the Godfather.
